{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0104_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e22dbb1a306b03c443d9e3c0330669c0e3509d86ba62b646d56c7fa8efe3679d", "ja": "育、新しい衣装気に入ったみたいだな。\nもう何度も、衣装合わせしてるんだって？", "zh": "育，看来你很喜欢新服装呢。\n听说你已经试穿了好几次？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0104_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "2997296ba653f1bc0c5de87f9867ec476fcd51d11679207aed87681debbe1abf", "ja": "だって、ライブが待ちきれないんだもん！\nふわふわモコモコで、かわいいでしょ♪", "zh": "因为人家已经等不及要办演唱会了！\n软绵绵又毛茸茸的，很可爱吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0104_1002_030iku", "source_sha256": "5245aead8c26eba19496086a958dd6b427638464dcc9d8bc20963fbb5a881efd", "ja": "さわるとね、すっごく気持ちいいんだよ。\nほら、{$P$}さんも、さわってみて？", "zh": "摸起来的触感啊，舒服得不得了喔。\n来，{$P$}先生也摸摸看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0104_1003_p", "source_sha256": "212e1bdc061e8aec3466cfe236127f96cf032926c7ff69859b4d69151db366f0", "ja": "そうか。それじゃあ……。", "zh": "这样啊，那我就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
