{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0104_2000_p", "source_sha256": "82750a91675a5327fb1a3d4886882c3f88d7c3dcfd604bb9da6bcae5314e9b96", "ja": "おぉ、確かに。\nふわふわで、モコモコだ……。", "zh": "喔喔，确实。\n软绵绵又毛茸茸的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0104_2001_030iku", "source_sha256": "42b36c05b920d7830b5a9a30e6217e80dcdd01e7ac109a34d03eba1c9b2337b5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nわたしと、おんなじこと言ってる！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n你跟我讲了一样的话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0104_2002_p", "source_sha256": "12d64d298d76ebb135b279a9206c9f6520b178df31c6258eceb53edbe7b20733", "ja": "うん、そうだな。でも、そんなに気に入ってるなら、\nレッスンも衣装を着てやってみるか？", "zh": "嗯，对啊。不过，你这么喜欢这套服装的话，\n要不要试试看穿着它练习？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0104_2003_030iku", "source_sha256": "88003ede7e87113b38f501a28fc87dfd583ce7d756d99b887fe04d501d3c5fb5", "ja": "あっ……えっとね。実は、\nもうレッスンでも着せてもらっちゃったんだ。", "zh": "啊……其实呀，\n我已经穿着它练习过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0104_2004_030iku", "source_sha256": "be48a271623b12485f0581184c9a5aba375d22ed28fe70acdb8e7041881702df", "ja": "これ、マントみたいでしょ？　動いた時に、\n見えなくなったりしないかって、美咲さんが。", "zh": "这个不是很像斗篷吗？美咲姊姊有问我，\n动起来的时候，服装会不会挡住视线。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0104_2005_030iku", "source_sha256": "c5a6b0a549a06ae28435a8e2f61be4a574d6d608ea3b7aca09741c7b7c61b70b", "ja": "でもね、ぜんぜん大丈夫だったよ！　あったかいのに\n動きやすいし、ダンスすると、すごくかわいいし……♪", "zh": "不过，完全没问题喔！穿起来很暖，\n却很方便活动，跳起舞来也非常可爱……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0104_2006_p", "source_sha256": "c080837aba7d8f5c9dd49851ebf8f104c1ab585a247e6d210e5b02e2fb469e8b", "ja": "そうか。なら今度のライブでも、\nお客さんに楽しんでもらえそうだな。", "zh": "这样啊，看来下次的演唱会，\n也能让观众大饱眼福了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
