{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0104_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0104_2015_p", "source_sha256": "b322cf0e0d0518a0a32e145824dff8d02b77097fce320e8f833efbf4f712824c", "ja": "それは、その……衣装が汚れちゃったりするだろ？\n大人の事情ってやつだよ、うん。", "zh": "因为……服装可能会弄脏不是吗？\n总之有些不便明说的原因啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
